Z||000000||Jaygee79||10-15-2001||02:02 PM||||OK I posted this a while back.  I haven't been able to fix it yet.<P>Whenever I try to save a GIF (animation) to my computer from the web it saves it as a bmp and it won't let me change the file type.  I tried the Repair Internet Explorer thing and it worked for a few days but it is doing it again.  I tried the repair thing again but it didn't work this time.<P>Does anyone know how to fix that?||||reg||1
Z||000001||fierospeeder||10-15-2001||02:07 PM||||are you on aol?<P>i know on aol, it will compress files and change the extensions.<P>you should just right click the item and click save.  <P>try going to explorer and rename the file and add gif to it.<P>you can also view the html and see if the file your talking about is really a gif||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jaygee79||10-15-2001||02:41 PM||||<B>are you on aol?</B><P>yes<P><B>i know on aol, it will compress files and change the extensions.</B><P>i have it set to 'never compress images'<P><B>you should just right click the item and click save.</B><P>that's how i'm doing it.<P><B>try going to explorer and rename the file and add gif to it.</B><P>it still doesn't animate anymore when i do that.  i just tried it.<P><B>you can also view the html and see if the file your talking about is really a gif</B><P>yeah it is.  i double checked to make sure.<P>thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||84Bill||10-15-2001||02:49 PM||||Open explorer<BR>click on view then folder options<BR>click on file types<BR>Look for the GIF extension. <P>If you dont have one, thats the problem. If there is no association with the GIF extension then your computer will not know how to open it and may pick MSPAINT by default.<P>If it is there then delete it and install a GIF editor. OR Delete it close everything and reboot the computer, then open a file with a .GIF extension. This will prompt you for a program to open it with just select Internet Explorer.<P>The best solution is to get a gif editor and install it. there are a few out there for free.||||reg||1
